@startuml fig_context_diagram
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    BorderColor #2980B9
    BorderThickness 2
    FontColor #1A3A5C
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #D6EAF8
    BorderColor #2980B9
    FontColor #1A3A5C
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #D5F5E3
    BorderColor #27AE60
}

skinparam cloud {
    BackgroundColor #FDEBD0
    BorderColor #E67E22
}

title <b>System Context Diagram (C4 Level 1)</b>\nWorkforce Data Processing Tool

' === USER ACTORS ===
actor "Public Sector\nAnalyst" as analyst #D6EAF8
actor "Domain\nExpert" as expert #D6EAF8
actor "System\nAdministrator" as admin #D6EAF8

' === MAIN SYSTEM ===
rectangle "<<System>>\n**Workforce Analysis Tool**\n\nAI-powered tool that maps Lithuanian\nstudy program descriptions to\nISCO-08 profession codes\nusing XLM-RoBERTa deep learning." as wfTool #2980B9

' === EXTERNAL SYSTEMS ===
cloud "<<External System>>\n**Lithuanian Open Data Portal**\n(data.gov.lt)\nStudy program registry\n(JSON / CSV)" as dataPortal #EAECEE
cloud "<<External System>>\n**ILO ISCO-08 Database**\nStandardized occupation\ntaxonomy — 436 unit groups\n(XML / CSV)" as ilo #EAECEE
cloud "<<External System>>\n**HuggingFace Model Hub**\nPre-trained XLM-RoBERTa-base\nmodel weights (270M params)\n(HTTPS)" as hfHub #EAECEE

' === RELATIONSHIPS ===
analyst --> wfTool : "Submits programs,\nreviews predictions\n[HTTPS / Browser]"
expert --> wfTool : "Validates annotations,\nreviews metrics\n[HTTPS / Browser]"
admin --> wfTool : "Configures system,\ndeploys models\n[SSH / CLI]"

wfTool --> dataPortal : "Fetches study programs\n[REST API]"
wfTool --> ilo : "Downloads taxonomy\n[HTTP / XML]"
wfTool --> hfHub : "Downloads model weights\n[HTTPS]"

legend right
|= Shape |= Meaning |
| Blue rectangle | Internal System |
| Gray cloud | External System |
| Blue actor | Person / User Role |
endlegend

footer Figure 3.3.1. System Context Diagram (C4 Level 1).\nShows the Workforce Analysis Tool interactions with user roles and external systems. (Created by the author)
@enduml
